Corpus and crash regressions for fuzz_linux_loader.

valid-small.bzImage: synthetic x86-64 image reaching boot layout planning.
truncated-setup.bzImage: setup_sects=0 default extends past the file.
overflow-address.bzImage: preferred kernel address near UINT64_MAX.
low-initrd-limit.bzImage: initrd_addr_max below the kernel workspace.

Inputs are replayed by meson test --suite fuzz-regression.
Write generated inputs to a separate FIRST corpus directory when fuzzing.
